---
import { PRODUCT_NAME } from '../../config';
---
<section class="s wrap rule fs" id="catch-up" data-name="Catch up" aria-labelledby="c-h">
  <div class="feat">
    <div class="copy">
      <h2 id="c-h">See what happened <span class="soft">since you last looked.</span></h2>
      <p>{PRODUCT_NAME} remembers the commit you were caught up to, not a clock. It shows everything that reached main after it, grouped by issue or by area, so twenty PRs read as four pieces of work.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="halo"><div class="app lit-shot fade-out">
      <div class="app-top"><span class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Catch up</div>
      <div class="app-main">
        <div class="grp-h"><span>Since <u>your checkpoint ▾</u> · Tuesday 18:40</span><span>Mark caught up ⇧C</span></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="grp-h"><span style="color:var(--text)">WEB-142 · New onboarding</span><span>4 PRs</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="num">#110</span><span>Add the welcome screen</span><span class="tag">merged</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="num">#111</span><span>Save progress between steps</span><span class="tag">merged</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="num">#112</span><span>Let people skip step 2</span><span class="tag">merged</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="num">#113</span><span>Track who finishes onboarding</span><span class="tag">merged</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card"><div class="grp-h" style="margin:0"><span style="color:var(--text)">apps/web</span><span>3 PRs ▸</span></div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="grp-h" style="margin:0"><span style="color:var(--text)">packages/tokens</span><span>1 PR ▸</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
    <div class="facts3 facts4">
      <div><h4>Counts at a glance</h4><p>Merged, stuck and ready, plus main's CI with GitHub connected.</p></div>
      <div><h4>Any starting point</h4><p>Your last checkpoint, yesterday, last week or a tag.</p></div>
      <div><h4>One PR at a time</h4><p>Walk through what landed with <kbd>⇧↵</kbd>.</p></div>
      <div><h4>Agent work, marked</h4><p>Agent-made branches get a badge. <kbd>A</kbd> shows only them.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
